149+  00E7              ; -------------------------------------------------------------------------
150+  00E7              ; Receive one ATM -> NeoGS ABI 1.0 frame through ZX DMA.
151+  00E7              ; Entry: resident dispatcher consumed E0h from ZXCMD; CBIT remains asserted.
152+  00E7              ; Resident code, stack and interrupt handlers must stay in WIN0-WIN2.
153+  00E7              ; OUT: carry clear/A=0, HL=#5000 and BC=derived frame size; otherwise
154+  00E7              ; carry set/A=status. Diagnostic DMA destination is physical 00D000h on
155+  00E7              ; page 03h, matching Project125. Production page-42 staging is not yet tested.
156+  00E7              ; -------------------------------------------------------------------------
